Review complete. The review-floor arithmetic matches between the panel, gatekeeper, and database triggers; I found no off-by-one or `None`-handling defect there. The blocking issues are in separation-of-powers and merge failure/concurrency paths, plus one explicit repository-rule violation.
Static tracing and the available read-only verification are complete. The suite command was attempted but could not execute tests because the sandbox has no writable temporary directory; collection found 206 tests.
  ✓ Read the repository rules and inspect the exact branch diff
  ✓ Trace changed runtime paths against surrounding code and database guards
  ✓ Run the full harness test suite and investigate relevant failures
  ✓ Report ranked, concrete findings and a GO/NO-GO verdict
